# This repository publishes only its README and this ignore file.
# Everything else — source, docs, build output, local state — stays local and is
# never committed. The rule below is a whitelist: ignore every top-level entry,
# then re-admit exactly the two files that belong here.

/*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Belt and braces: even if the whitelist above is ever relaxed, these must never
# be committed.
*.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.enc
*.keyring
keyring.json
keyring.bin
*.wal
*.snapshot
*.mdb
*.lz4
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.log
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.gz
